    LLM: 'Minimize deadwood by forming sets and runs; use wild cards in combinations where they replace missing cards.\n\nTrack which cards have been discarded to infer what opponents need; take from the discard only when it completes or extends a combination.\n\nPlan round-by-round: in early rounds with few cards, prioritize flexibility; in later rounds with more cards, optimize for going out before opponents.',
